    {
      "children": [
        {
          "content": "You attempt to subdue a target with an attack and a follow-up grab. Make a melee Strike. If it hits and deals damage, you can attempt an ",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "display": "Athletics",
          "kind": "crossref",
          "targetId": "skill/athletics"
        },
        {
          "content": " check to Grapple the creature you hit. If you’re wielding a flail, you can ignore Grapple’s requirement that you have a hand free. Both attacks count toward your multiple attack penalty, but the penalty doesn’t increase until after you’ve made both of them.",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
